{"id":2109,"level":44,"name":"Мат в один хід (3)","group":"Практика","format":35,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>What conditions must be met for checkmate? Before checkmate occurs, several requirements must be fulfilled:</span></p><p><br></p><ol><li data-list='ordered'><span class='ql-ui' contenteditable='false'></span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The opposing king is in check.</span></li><li data-list='ordered'><span class='ql-ui' contenteditable='false'></span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The king cannot escape.</span></li><li data-list='ordered'><span class='ql-ui' contenteditable='false'></span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>No defender can block the check.</span></li><li data-list='ordered'><span class='ql-ui' contenteditable='false'></span><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The attacking piece cannot be captured.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>In this lesson, aim to fulfill all these conditions and deliver checkmate in one move.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Fun fact:</strong><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'> Did you know that the fastest way to deliver checkmate is called âFoolâs Mateâ? It happens in just two moves and leaves the king with no escape options.</span></p><p><br></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"5rk1/5ppp/5r2/6q1/4Q3/4P1P1/3N1PK1/7R w - - 0 30","pgn":"{[%csl Rh7][%evp 0,1,29999,-30000]} {[#]} 30. Qxh7# * ","text":"<p>Білі можуть поставити мат, перемістивши ферзя, щоб взяти чорного пішака. ферзя захищає біла тура, і дуже важливо, щоб деякі чорні фігури також блокували поля втечі на дошці свого короля.</p>","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":78020,"fen":"r3k2r/1p1nbpp1/pq6/3p3p/2